[17.451909, "o", "Here's the status of the pods in the default namespace:                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mbroken-app-5bcbdf7c9f-nqxvm\u001b[0m: Not ready, ImagePullBackOff (0 restarts)                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mload-generator\u001b[0m: Not ready, Unknown status (0 restarts)                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-8wc8x\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (3 restarts)                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-b6z7k\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (3 restarts)                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-hgghs\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (17 restarts)                                                                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-q94wj\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (17 restarts)                                                                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-qbcqj\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (3 restarts)                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mnginx-c95765fd4-zq7hk\u001b[0m: Ready, Running (3 restarts)                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mstress-test\u001b[0m: Not ready, Completed status (0 restarts)                                                                                                                                      \r\n\r\nThe \u001b[1;36;40mbroken-app\u001b[0m and \u001b[1;36;40mload-generator\u001b[0m pods are not running due to issues with pulling the image and an unknown status respectively. The \u001b[1;36;40mnginx\u001b[0m pods have varying numbers of restarts, which could  \r\nindicate some instability. The \u001b[1;36;40mstress-test\u001b[0m pod has completed its task.                                                                                                                        \r\n\r\n\u001b[1mConclusion\u001b[0m: Investigate the image pull issues for \u001b[1;36;40mbroken-app\u001b[0m and determine why \u001b[1;36;40mload-generator\u001b[0m is in an Unknown state. Additionally, monitor the high number of restarts for the \u001b[1;36;40mnginx\u001b[0m pods to \r\nensure they are stable.                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n"]
